 Software Ecosystems; movie Recommendation Using Web Crawling; A Quadrant Partitioned-RRT* (QP-RRT*) Autonomous Agent; framework of a Smart Contract System for Improved Supply Chain Management; Integrating AI, IoT, and Drones for Sustainable Apple Orchard Monitoring in Society 5.0.},
